WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.830
[Fierce Power Ballad Intro — Electric Guitar and Flute]

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.500
I saw the static in your eyes

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.475
The silent screams, the practiced lies

00:00:33.595 --> 00:00:37.658
A painted smile, a hollow shell

00:00:37.758 --> 00:00:40.540
Trapped inside a private hell

00:00:42.082 --> 00:00:46.200
I tried to call, I tried to warn

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.500
On that cold and broken morn

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.000
You couldn't hear my quiet plea

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.932
But you are finally back with me

00:00:56.213 --> 00:01:02.000
And I will never let you go again

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
This is a promise, not a "what if" or a "when"

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.000
If the darkness ever calls your name

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.905
I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame

00:01:18.105 --> 00:01:26.208
And if I have to, with my own two hands

00:01:26.849 --> 00:01:33.437
I'll drag you back from those broken lands

00:01:33.437 --> 00:02:04.239
[Fierce Technical Duel Between Distorted Electric Guitar and Piercing Flute]

00:02:04.239 --> 00:02:07.622
I'll be the flute song in your head

00:02:07.762 --> 00:02:10.925
For every single word unsaid

00:02:14.848 --> 00:02:18.200
A steady note, a gentle sound

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.173
On this new and solid ground

00:02:24.098 --> 00:02:27.500
No more silence, no more fear

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.200
As long as I am standing here

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.251
You'll never have to walk alone

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.475
I'll bring my broken brother home

00:02:38.303 --> 00:02:43.500
And I will never let you go again

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:49.500
This is a promise, not a "what if" or a "when"

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:54.500
If the darkness ever calls your name

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:59.156
I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame

00:02:59.196 --> 00:03:07.565
And if I have to, with my own two hands

00:03:08.186 --> 00:03:14.750
I'll drag you back from those broken lands

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:19.920
[Sustained Flute & Guitar Resolution]
